  "title": "Pecan-Crusted Baked Salmon with Lemon-Dill Aioli",
  "description": "A zesty lemon-dill aioli and crunchy pecans are smothered and baked atop fresh salmon fillets for tons of extra savory flavor.",
  "authors": [
